// The walker example: a stick figure walks across the window and back, a
// picture of the resources folder for each step of its walk. Its target is
// the web, in C# with Avalonia: the window lives on the server, where the
// timer's handler moves the figure, and the browser shows it. The modules
// are in the walker folder next to this file.
project Walker
    title "Walker"
    stack csharp avalonia web
    output "out"
    language "en"
    datasource main sqlite "data/walker.db"
